    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Mrs. Tittlemouse partially closed her front door to keep out the bees, specifically to prevent them from intruding into her tidy home. She was annoyed by the mess and noise they made while buzzing around her. By closing the door slightly, she aimed to regulate their access while maintaining some ventilation. \n\nFinal answer: \\boxed{{To keep out the bees and prevent them from intruding into her tidy home.}}",
