      "generated_answer": "Jerome realizes that Theodore is his own son. He identifies him by a marking below his shoulder when Theodore removes his shirt. This revelation occurs as Jerome pleads for Theodore's life while speaking with Manfred. \n\n\\boxed{\\text{Jerome realizes Theodore is his son.}}",
