      "generated_answer": "When Sam refuses to help with the house and George refuses to give him money, Sam considers becoming a male prostitute to get money quickly. He nearly goes through with it but flees during his first encounter out of fear and confusion. This experience leads him to steal George's Vicodin instead.  \n\\boxed{\\text{Sam thinks about becoming a male prostitute.}}",
