    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The sentiments expressed in the excerpt from the Populist Party Platform closely align with those of D. William Jennings Bryan, who represented similar ideals in the Populist movement during the late 19th century, particularly in his focus on fighting against the economic injustices faced by ordinary people. Both emphasize the struggle against the established powers and advocate for the interests of \"the plain people.\" Thus, the correct answer is \\(\\boxed{D}\\).",
