      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minTimeToRevert(word: str, k: int) -> int:\n    n = len(word)\n    for i in range(1, n // k + 1):\n        if word[i * k:] == word[:n - i * k]:\n            return i\n    return (n + k - 1) // k\n```",
