      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not input_data: return\n    N = int(input_data[0])\n    grid = [[False for _ in range(100)] for _ in range(100)]\n    for i in range(N):\n        a, b, c, d = map(int, input_data[1 + i*4 : 5 + i*4])\n        for x in range(a, b):\n            for y in range(c, d):\n                grid[x][y] = True\n    print(sum(row.count(True) for row in grid))\n\nsolve()\n```",
