      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom math import gcd\nfrom collections import defaultdict, deque\n\ndef canTraverseAllPairs(nums):\n    n = len(nums)\n    if n < 2:\n        return True\n    \n    # Create a graph where an edge exists if gcd(nums[i], nums[j]) > 1\n    graph = defaultdict(list)\n    \n    # Build the graph\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            if gcd(nums[i], nums[j]) > 1:\n                graph[i].append(j)\n                graph[j].append(i)\n    \n    # Perform BFS/DFS to check connectivity\n    visited = [False] * n\n    \n    def bfs(start):\n        queue = deque([start])\n        visited[start] = True\n        while queue:\n            node = queue.popleft()\n            for neighbor in graph[node]:\n                if not visited[neighbor]:\n                    visited[neighbor] = True\n                    queue.append(neighbor)\n    \n    # Start BFS from the first index\n    bfs(0)\n    \n    # Check if all indices were visited\n    return all(visited)\n```",
